  "body": "Hey folks!\r\n\r\nThank you for the amazing work on the standard. I have been following the progress for a while now and even using the reference implementation in side projects. \r\n\r\nIn the process, I started writing [pipes.js](http://pipes.js.org), a Highland.js inspired utility library for web streams.\r\n\r\nIt'd be great if I could get comments and suggestions on the same. There're more modules in the works than currently displayed. I'm happy to elaborate on any design decisions. \r\n\r\nCc- @neovov @kentonv @domenic @tyoshino",
